WEBVTT

00:03:27.703 --> 00:03:30.665
gender equality and sustainability?

00:03:32.708 --> 00:03:35.920
Well, we need to do something
that seems very simple,

00:03:35.962 --> 00:03:38.089
yet very often overlooked.

00:03:38.422 --> 00:03:40.633
When investing in green projects

00:03:40.633 --> 00:03:44.345
and developing green products,
crafting green legislations,

00:03:44.387 --> 00:03:49.976
we need to make sure that women
as well as men will equally benefit.

00:03:50.601 --> 00:03:52.478
Not more, not less.

00:03:52.478 --> 00:03:54.438
Just equally.

00:03:57.108 --> 00:03:58.734
Might seem obvious.

00:03:58.776 --> 00:04:02.280
You might even think,
"Isn't that what we're already doing?"